[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 1.2, "end": 4.68}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 4.94, "end": 5.6}, {"text": "And today we have another great elementary lesson for you all.", "start": 6.0, "end": 9.14}, {"text": "That's right. We've got a lesson for all you sports fans out there.", "start": 9.34, "end": 12.5}, {"text": "Right. We're doing a podcast on sports today. We're starting off with basketball.", "start": 12.6, "end": 17.26}, {"text": "So we've got lots of language about basketball and sports in this lesson today.", "start": 17.5, "end": 23.22}, {"text": "Great. So let's take a look at our vocabulary preview.", "start": 23.66, "end": 26.28}, {"text": "Vocabulary preview.", "start": 27.3, "end": 28.3}, {"text": "Two words for you today. The first one is foul.", "start": 28.919999999999998, "end": 32.54}, {"text": "Foul.", "start": 33.120000000000005, "end": 33.6}, {"text": "Foul.", "start": 33.84, "end": 34.16}, {"text": "A foul.", "start": 34.94, "end": 35.84}, {"text": "Basically, it's an action in a game that is not allowed.", "start": 36.58, "end": 39.96}, {"text": "Right. So if you're playing basketball and you kick the other player.", "start": 40.26, "end": 43.42}, {"text": "That's a foul.", "start": 43.56, "end": 44.2}, {"text": "That's a foul. That's a pretty big foul.", "start": 44.3, "end": 45.68}, {"text": "Yeah. If you're playing soccer and you pick up the ball.", "start": 45.8, "end": 48.96}, {"text": "That's also a foul.", "start": 49.12, "end": 50.16}, {"text": "Our second word is ref.", "start": 50.68, "end": 53.08}, {"text": "Ref. R-E-F.", "start": 53.42, "end": 54.8}, {"text": "Also known as a referee.", "start": 55.0, "end": 56.5}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 56.92, "end": 57.4}, {"text": "Right. So a referee is...", "start": 57.4, "end": 59.82}, {"text": "Basically like the judge of a game.", "start": 59.82, "end": 61.84}, {"text": "The judge of the game.", "start": 62.08, "end": 62.84}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 62.98, "end": 63.06}, {"text": "So he's the one that will...", "start": 63.06, "end": 64.4}, {"text": "Say, that was a foul.", "start": 64.4, "end": 65.7}, {"text": "That was a foul.", "start": 65.74, "end": 66.36}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 66.5, "end": 66.84}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 67.22, "end": 67.3}, {"text": "Ref.", "start": 67.34, "end": 67.62}, {"text": "Also known as referee.", "start": 67.96, "end": 69.26}, {"text": "Okay. So two great words.", "start": 69.26, "end": 71.44}, {"text": "We're going to hear them in our dialogue.", "start": 71.64, "end": 73.08}, {"text": "And we're going to be listening to two guys who are watching a basketball game on TV.", "start": 73.38, "end": 78.94}, {"text": "Hey, has the game started yet?", "start": 89.9, "end": 92.04}, {"text": "Yeah, about five minutes ago.", "start": 92.42, "end": 93.72}, {"text": "Who's winning?", "start": 93.92, "end": 94.42}, {"text": "Bulls, of course.", "start": 94.6, "end": 95.6}, {"text": "What?", "start": 97.32000000000001, "end": 97.84}, {"text": "That wasn't a foul.", "start": 98.0, "end": 99.14}, {"text": "Oh, come on, ref.", "start": 99.44, "end": 100.42}, {"text": "Don't worry.", "start": 100.58, "end": 101.1}, {"text": "Shaq always screws up free throws.", "start": 101.54, "end": 103.46}, {"text": "You're right.", "start": 105.48, "end": 106.14}, {"text": "He didn't make the shot.", "start": 106.48, "end": 107.34}, {"text": "Dirk Minifield was looking down at the hoop.", "start": 108.02000000000001, "end": 111.06}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 111.72, "end": 112.16}, {"text": "That was a great shot.", "start": 112.86, "end": 114.12}, {"text": "Three-pointer.", "start": 114.3, "end": 114.66}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 114.78, "end": 114.84}, {"text": "Did you see that?", "start": 115.14, "end": 115.96}, {"text": "He traveled and the ref didn't even call it.", "start": 116.18, "end": 118.2}, {"text": "This ref needs glasses.", "start": 118.3, "end": 119.68}, {"text": "Hey, ref.", "start": 120.06, "end": 120.46}, {"text": "Open your eyes.", "start": 120.62, "end": 121.44}, {"text": "Can't believe he didn't see that.", "start": 122.96000000000001, "end": 124.22}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 124.98, "end": 125.42}, {"text": "End of the first quarter.", "start": 125.92, "end": 126.76}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 127.44, "end": 127.6}, {"text": "I'm going to make a beer run.", "start": 127.6, "end": 128.5}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 134.08, "end": 134.7}, {"text": "A really common situation whenever you're watching games with friends, right?", "start": 134.82, "end": 138.66}, {"text": "You need to get a beer.", "start": 138.8, "end": 139.64}, {"text": "We'll talk about that in a little while.", "start": 140.7, "end": 142.5}, {"text": "Let's take a look at language takeaway.", "start": 142.72, "end": 144.78}, {"text": "Language takeaway.", "start": 146.68, "end": 147.56}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 148.82, "end": 149.26}, {"text": "Let's take a look at our first word on language takeaway.", "start": 149.38, "end": 151.62}, {"text": "Free throw.", "start": 152.78, "end": 153.52}, {"text": "Free throw.", "start": 154.24, "end": 155.12}, {"text": "Free throw.", "start": 155.58, "end": 156.36}, {"text": "Free throw.", "start": 156.52, "end": 156.92}, {"text": "This one's a bit hard to say, isn't it?", "start": 157.6, "end": 158.98}, {"text": "It's a little bit hard to explain, but if you're playing basketball and if someone fouls you,", "start": 159.06, "end": 164.3}, {"text": "you get a free throw.", "start": 164.48, "end": 166.04}, {"text": "So that's when all the players line up around you and you can throw the ball.", "start": 166.3, "end": 171.32}, {"text": "To the basket without anyone blocking you or anything.", "start": 171.5, "end": 175.06}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 175.06, "end": 175.16}, {"text": "A little bit complicated, but I'm sure the basketball fans understand what a free throw is.", "start": 175.46, "end": 179.32}, {"text": "All right.", "start": 179.52, "end": 179.9}, {"text": "Our next word is...", "start": 179.9, "end": 181.44}, {"text": "Make the shot.", "start": 181.98, "end": 182.58}, {"text": "Make the shot.", "start": 182.84, "end": 184.22}, {"text": "Make the shot.", "start": 184.7, "end": 185.78}, {"text": "Let's listen to some examples and we'll understand the meaning of make the shot.", "start": 185.78, "end": 190.86}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 192.06, "end": 192.86}, {"text": "I can't believe it.", "start": 194.82, "end": 196.1}, {"text": "He made the shot from the other side of the court.", "start": 196.26, "end": 198.1}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 202.04, "end": 202.78}, {"text": "There's no way he's going to make that shot.", "start": 206.32, "end": 208.1}, {"text": "He's way too far away from the net.", "start": 208.38, "end": 210.22}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 214.84, "end": 215.66}, {"text": "If Gretzky makes a shot, they're going to win the Stanley Cup.", "start": 218.84, "end": 221.64}, {"text": "So it's clear now to make the shot is to successfully put the ball in the basket.", "start": 225.3, "end": 230.06}, {"text": "You can use this expression in other sports as well, right?", "start": 230.06, "end": 232.84}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 233.12, "end": 233.34}, {"text": "You could use it in hockey to make the shot.", "start": 233.42, "end": 235.48}, {"text": "You could also use it in golf.", "start": 235.6, "end": 236.94}, {"text": "In a lot of different sports, they use the term to shoot.", "start": 237.18, "end": 239.88}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 240.06, "end": 240.22}, {"text": "Shoot the ball.", "start": 240.26, "end": 240.8}, {"text": "So anytime you shoot the ball, you can make the shot.", "start": 240.98, "end": 243.02}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 243.32, "end": 243.72}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 243.94, "end": 244.14}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 244.58, "end": 244.84}, {"text": "Our next word today, three-pointer.", "start": 244.92, "end": 246.82}, {"text": "Three-pointer.", "start": 247.54, "end": 248.34}, {"text": "Three-pointer.", "start": 249.14, "end": 249.94}, {"text": "A three-pointer.", "start": 250.16, "end": 251.1}, {"text": "It's a shot in basketball when you get three points.", "start": 251.82, "end": 254.64}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 254.78, "end": 255.0}, {"text": "Usually this shot is taken from further out.", "start": 255.44, "end": 257.94}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 258.12, "end": 258.24}, {"text": "Farther distance.", "start": 258.24, "end": 259.06}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 259.3, "end": 259.4}, {"text": "So it's a little bit more difficult to make this shot.", "start": 259.56, "end": 262.2}, {"text": "You know, sometimes people might say a three-point shot or something like that.", "start": 262.44, "end": 266.74}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 266.74, "end": 267.06}, {"text": "But our English pod learners, they know.", "start": 267.16, "end": 269.5}, {"text": "It's a three-pointer.", "start": 269.68, "end": 271.04}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 271.08, "end": 271.4}, {"text": "You'll sound really knowledgeable, really cool using that one.", "start": 271.5, "end": 274.54}, {"text": "Three-pointer.", "start": 274.66, "end": 275.28}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 275.38, "end": 275.52}, {"text": "And our last word today, travel.", "start": 275.8, "end": 278.74}, {"text": "Travel.", "start": 279.08, "end": 279.58}, {"text": "To travel.", "start": 279.98, "end": 280.48}, {"text": "Travel.", "start": 280.78, "end": 281.06}, {"text": "When you walk with the basketball.", "start": 281.86, "end": 283.32}, {"text": "Well, technically, you're allowed to take two steps in basketball.", "start": 283.74, "end": 287.16}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 287.42, "end": 287.66}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 287.66, "end": 287.78}, {"text": "So when you take more than two steps, then it's traveling.", "start": 288.1, "end": 291.32}, {"text": "I understand.", "start": 291.76, "end": 291.88}, {"text": "So yeah, traveling means to take more than two steps with the ball.", "start": 292.46, "end": 295.76}, {"text": "Well, let's listen to the dialogue a second time.", "start": 295.9, "end": 298.04}, {"text": "This time it'll be a bit slower so that we can understand some of these great phrases we just", "start": 298.04, "end": 302.56}, {"text": "talked about.", "start": 302.56, "end": 303.08}, {"text": "Hey, has the game started yet?", "start": 308.16, "end": 311.08}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 311.46, "end": 312.16}, {"text": "About five minutes ago.", "start": 312.16, "end": 314.16}, {"text": "Oh, who's winning?", "start": 314.4, "end": 315.68}, {"text": "The Bulls, of course.", "start": 316.1, "end": 317.94}, {"text": "What?", "start": 318.74, "end": 319.5}, {"text": "That wasn't a foul!", "start": 319.7, "end": 321.14}, {"text": "Oh, come on, ref!", "start": 321.42, "end": 322.7}, {"text": "", "start": 322.7, "end": 322.7}, {"text": "Don't worry.", "start": 323.24, "end": 324.12}, {"text": "Shaq always screws up free throws.", "start": 324.84000000000003, "end": 326.98}, {"text": "Yeah, you were right.", "start": 327.2, "end": 328.66}, {"text": "He didn't make the shot.", "start": 328.9, "end": 330.22}, {"text": "Yeah, that was a great shot.", "start": 331.36, "end": 333.72}, {"text": "What?", "start": 333.96, "end": 334.16}, {"text": "Three-pointer, yeah?", "start": 334.3, "end": 335.32}, {"text": "Oh, did you see that?", "start": 335.72, "end": 337.02}, {"text": "He traveled and the ref didn't even call it.", "start": 337.24, "end": 339.62}, {"text": "This ref needs glasses.", "start": 340.26, "end": 341.74}, {"text": "Hey, ref!", "start": 342.32, "end": 343.2}, {"text": "Open your eyes!", "start": 343.62, "end": 344.78}, {"text": "I can't believe you didn't see that.", "start": 345.5, "end": 347.34}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 348.42, "end": 348.9}, {"text": "The end of the first quarter.", "start": 349.3, "end": 350.28}, {"text": "Hey, I'm going to make a beer run.", "start": 350.64, "end": 352.38}, {"text": "Sweet.", "start": 352.5, "end": 352.7}, {"text": "All right, sports fans.", "start": 357.4, "end": 358.72}, {"text": "So now let's take a look at Fluency Builder.", "start": 358.88, "end": 361.36}, {"text": "Fluency Builder.", "start": 362.64, "end": 363.6}, {"text": "Okay, today on Fluency Builder, we have two really common words that you would listen to", "start": 363.82, "end": 368.7}, {"text": "while you're watching a game.", "start": 368.7, "end": 369.72}, {"text": "Yeah, these are sort of slangy words, hey?", "start": 369.82, "end": 371.88}, {"text": "Yeah, they're kind of a common...", "start": 372.06, "end": 373.7}, {"text": "Like informal.", "start": 373.7, "end": 374.42}, {"text": "Informal.", "start": 374.62, "end": 375.06}, {"text": "The first one that we have is screw up.", "start": 375.5, "end": 377.86}, {"text": "Screw up.", "start": 378.0, "end": 379.0}, {"text": "Screw up.", "start": 379.6, "end": 380.48}, {"text": "Screw up.", "start": 380.64, "end": 381.36}, {"text": "To screw up.", "start": 381.58, "end": 382.38}, {"text": "Yeah, so this is a good way of saying...", "start": 382.48, "end": 384.7}, {"text": "To make a mistake.", "start": 385.54, "end": 386.88}, {"text": "Let's listen to some examples of how this word is used.", "start": 387.82, "end": 390.56}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 391.84, "end": 392.64}, {"text": "Jill, you really screwed up this time.", "start": 395.9, "end": 397.92}, {"text": "You're fired.", "start": 397.92, "end": 398.84}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 403.84, "end": 404.64}, {"text": "This game is important.", "start": 407.98, "end": 409.28}, {"text": "If you screw it up, we're out of the finals.", "start": 409.58, "end": 411.36}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 415.4, "end": 416.26}, {"text": "I'm sorry.", "start": 420.38, "end": 421.18}, {"text": "I know I screwed up.", "start": 421.4, "end": 422.16}, {"text": "Will you forgive me?", "start": 422.42, "end": 423.12}, {"text": "Okay, so screw up is mess up.", "start": 426.64, "end": 428.62}, {"text": "Yeah, make a mistake.", "start": 428.84, "end": 429.58}, {"text": "Make a mistake.", "start": 429.7, "end": 430.2}, {"text": "Uh-huh.", "start": 430.34, "end": 430.48}, {"text": "Great.", "start": 431.1, "end": 431.38}, {"text": "And our last word on Fluency Builder today, a beer run.", "start": 431.38, "end": 435.04}, {"text": "A beer run.", "start": 435.22, "end": 436.14}, {"text": "Beer run.", "start": 436.38, "end": 437.22}, {"text": "So what is this beer run?", "start": 437.54, "end": 439.48}, {"text": "You run to get beer.", "start": 439.74, "end": 440.92}, {"text": "You go to the store and get beer.", "start": 441.44, "end": 443.34}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 443.38, "end": 443.62}, {"text": "Get more beer.", "start": 443.7, "end": 444.16}, {"text": "So it's just an expression to meaning to go and get more beer.", "start": 444.16, "end": 447.54}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 447.74, "end": 447.9}, {"text": "Usually you're watching a game or you're at home with your friends.", "start": 448.08, "end": 451.26}, {"text": "You run out of beer.", "start": 451.36, "end": 452.44}, {"text": "So somebody has to go get some beer.", "start": 452.6, "end": 455.52}, {"text": "Go get some beer.", "start": 455.64, "end": 456.14}, {"text": "Make a beer run.", "start": 456.24, "end": 456.96}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 457.22, "end": 457.32}, {"text": "Hey, has the game started yet?", "start": 462.84000000000003, "end": 465.0}, {"text": "Yeah, about five minutes ago.", "start": 465.34, "end": 466.68}, {"text": "Who's winning?", "start": 466.86, "end": 467.36}, {"text": "Bulls, of course.", "start": 467.54, "end": 468.54}, {"text": "What?", "start": 470.26, "end": 470.78}, {"text": "That wasn't a foul.", "start": 470.88, "end": 472.08}, {"text": "Oh, come on, ref.", "start": 472.32, "end": 473.36}, {"text": "Don't worry.", "start": 473.52, "end": 474.04}, {"text": "Shaq always screws up free throws.", "start": 474.5, "end": 476.38}, {"text": "You were right.", "start": 478.16, "end": 479.1}, {"text": "He didn't make the shot.", "start": 479.3, "end": 480.3}, {"text": "Yeah, that was a great shot.", "start": 484.56, "end": 487.06}, {"text": "Three-pointer, yeah.", "start": 487.06, "end": 487.78}, {"text": "Did you see that?", "start": 488.06, "end": 488.92}, {"text": "He traveled and the ref didn't even call it.", "start": 489.1, "end": 491.14}, {"text": "This ref needs glasses.", "start": 491.18, "end": 492.62}, {"text": "Hey, ref, open your eyes.", "start": 492.98, "end": 494.38}, {"text": "Can't believe he didn't see that.", "start": 495.94, "end": 497.18}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 497.96000000000004, "end": 498.36}, {"text": "End of the first quarter.", "start": 498.78, "end": 499.7}, {"text": "All right, I'm going to make a beer run.", "start": 500.12, "end": 501.44}, {"text": "Okay, guys, I hope you enjoyed our lesson today.", "start": 505.5, "end": 507.7}, {"text": "We'll be bringing you more sports lessons in the future.", "start": 508.0, "end": 510.98}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 511.12, "end": 511.32}, {"text": "So if you have a particular sport that you want to learn about, you can tell us.", "start": 511.6, "end": 515.26}, {"text": "Come to our website.", "start": 515.52, "end": 516.56}, {"text": "Englishpod.com.", "start": 517.1400000000001, "end": 517.94}, {"text": "Yeah, and leave us your comments or your suggestions or any doubts that you have.", "start": 518.02, "end": 522.68}, {"text": "And we're always there to answer it.", "start": 523.0, "end": 524.46}, {"text": "So we'll see you there.", "start": 524.54, "end": 525.38}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 525.62, "end": 525.82}, {"text": "Until next time.", "start": 525.98, "end": 526.8}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 526.98, "end": 527.18}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 527.18, "end": 527.4}]